  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 35626,
  "published": "2026-07-25T20:27:12.89Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.2\n- Environments are open-ended: declare any prefix (Local_, Test_, Staging_) instead of only Development_/Production_.\n- EnvironmentOf returns the environment name; Environments exposes the published environment list.\n- Falls back to the consuming application's own app.config / appsettings.json when nothing has been published; SourceOf reports where a value came from.\n- SubscribeOnUiThread / SubscribeOn marshal SettingChanged onto a WPF or WinForms UI thread.\n- Recovers from FileSystemWatcher buffer overflow so a dropped event cannot leave stale values.",
